":2907223650,"text":"要するに、一つの網は一度しか使えないってこと。","nextNodeIds":[726720408]},{"nodeId":726720408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":1879759890,"text":"これは今のところ、まだ解決できてない難題なの。媒体が再利用できないと、とんでもないコストになっちゃう…","nextNodeIds":[726720409]},{"nodeId":726720409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":4142670898,"text":"私は引き続きこの網について研究するよ。一日も早くこの問題を解決できるように頑張る。","nextNodeIds":[726720410]},{"nodeId":726720410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":4073374282,"text":"もし、「四方八方の網」が必要なら、遠慮なく言ってね。","nextNodeIds":[726720411]},{"nodeId":726720411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":4010696618,"text":"それと、その…この網は今は動物しか捕まえられないけど、それでも作るのが大変なんだ…","nextNodeIds":[726720412]},{"nodeId":726720412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":1242898218,"text":"だから…えへへ、今度この網が欲しかったら、ちょっとだけ「材料費」をもらうね。","nextNodeIds":[726720413]},{"nodeId":726720413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3226,"speakerName":"若紫","textMapHash":3992224458,"text":"安心して！君は珊瑚の友人だから、決して多くは取らないよ。適正な価格で提供するから！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7267204,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7267204","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","429"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNLOCK_POINT"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["3226"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7267205,"order":5,"stepDescription":"珊瑚と会話する",